argazers":0,"master_branch":"main"},"pusher":{"name":"jobfynder-admin","email":"jobfynder.com@gmail.com"},"forced":false,"sender":{"login":"jobfynder-admin","id":213675935,"node_id":"U_kgDODLxvnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213675935?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin","html_url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created":false,"deleted":false,"base_ref":null,"compare":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/compare/7733a596e6f8...9d2d2a1de5d1","commits":[{"id":"1a6ebf63bd75730fb542252c684da7cea16e3314","tree_id":"37671720393918919c273011afdcdc0cce336d2b","distinct":true,"message":"Add activity module schema: task.isEvolving, notify_rules, notification_outbox\n\nFoundation for docs/jobfynder-activity-module-spec-v1.2.md and\ndocs/jobfynder-dittofeed-integration-spec-v1.0.md, adapted to this\ncodebase's Prisma/NestJS conventions (task/relationship_event, no new\nactivity_events table). Includes the full notify_rules event catalog\nseed and rule_configs seeds for the auto-rules built alongside this.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-02T23:46:29-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/1a6ebf63bd75730fb542252c684da7cea16e3314","author":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T23:46:29-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T23:46:29-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20260824120000_add_network_event_source_index/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20260902180000_task_evolving_and_notify_outbox/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20260902200000_reply_to_unanswered_rule_config/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20260902220000_notify_rules_seed_launch_rules/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20260902230000_notification_outbox_lease_columns/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20260902240000_notify_rules_full_catalog/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20260902250000_reconnect_dormant_contact_rule_config/migration.sql"],"removed":[],"modified":["prisma/schema.prisma"]},{"id":"152b26fd7dcab72b6ef2c21a0ab440832d244a39","tree_id":"1852720d4fc3932ca0d4d6b6a3e7524e0be156fb","distinct":true,"message":"Wire Dittofeed dispatch and the in-app Centrifugo webhook receiver\n\nCore dispatches to Dittofeed directly (no n8n — see\nskills/activity-module-notes.md for the reasoning): NotifyDispatchService\nis the single \"check notify_rules, write outbox\" primitive shared by\ntask-shaped rules and raw events; DittofeedDispatchService drains\nnotification_outbox and calls Dittofeed's public batch API, mirroring\nMessengerOutboxService's proven claim/retry pattern.\n\nDittofeedWebhookController is Job 3's in-app glue code: Dittofeed calls it,\nit verifies a shared secret (DittofeedWebhookAuthGuard, same shape as\nN8nAuthGuard), and publishes to the recipient's existing user:{userId}\nCentrifugo channel. CentrifugoPublisher extracted into its own\nCentrifugoModule to avoid a circular import between MessengerModule and\nNotificationsModule.\n\nDittofeedDispatchService.diagnostics() plugged into the existing /health\nendpoint alongside messengerRealtime, for Job 4 monitoring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-02T23:46:43-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/152b26fd7dcab72b6ef2c21a0ab440832d244a39","author":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T23:46:43-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T23:46:43-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/health/health.controller.spec.ts","src/messenger/centrifugo.module.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-dispatch.service.spec.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-dispatch.service.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-publisher.service.spec.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-publisher.service.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-webhook-auth.guard.spec.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-webhook-auth.guard.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-webhook.controller.spec.ts","src/notifications/dittofeed-webhook.controller.ts","src/notifications/dto/dittofeed-webhook.dto.ts","src/notifications/notifications.module.ts","src/notifications/notify-dispatch.service.spec.ts","src/notifications/notify-dispatch.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":[".env.example","src/app.module.ts","src/bench/bench.module.ts","src/config/configuration.ts","src/config/env.validation.ts","src/health/health.controller.ts","src/messenger/messenger.module.ts","src/tasks/task.module.ts","src/tasks/task.service.spec.ts","src/tasks/task.service.ts"]},{"id":"4a83fa14e71cea5918d2a12e505994910b6b883d","tree_id":"b4d48358ed4bc5af325b145320063fa3f5e8917b","distinct":true,"message":"Add reply_to_unanswered/profile_completion/reconnect_dormant_contact rules; wire submission and message notify events\n\nThree new nightly auto-rules following the existing no_response_chase\npattern (grouped/capped, spec v1.2 Part 4/§3.0b/§3.8):\n- reply_to_unanswered: Messenger, capped 5, oldest-unanswered-first\n- profile_completion: single evolving task per person, reuses the same\n  completion definition already shown on the profile page\n- reconnect_dormant_contact: NRM, strong-but-dormant relationships\n  (strengthScore, not strengthLabel — the dormancy override forces that\n  to QUIET and would make this rule un-triggerable via the label)\n\nBenchSubmissionService now fires stage_change plus a specific notify event\n(interview_scheduled/offer_extended/placement_confirmed/submission_rejected)\non every genuine Submission status transition. MessengerService fires\nmessage_received for every recipient except the sender, inside the same\ntransaction as the message write.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-02T23:46:58-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/4a83fa14e71cea5918d2a12e505994910b6b883d","author":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T23:46:58-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T23:46:58-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/activity/sources/submission-timeline.source.ts","src/bench/submission.service.spec.ts","src/cron/profile-completion.service.ts","src/cron/reconnect-dormant-contact.service.ts","src/cron/reply-to-unanswered.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["src/activity/activity.module.ts","src/bench/submission.service.ts","src/cron/cron.module.ts","src/messenger/messenger.service.spec.ts","src/messenger/messenger.service.ts","src/tasks/auto-rules/auto-rules.service.spec.ts","src/tasks/auto-rules/auto-rules.service.ts","src/tasks/rule-config/rule-config.constants.ts"]},{"id":"9d2d2a1de5d1f54444bb7230f3394e52095f45dc","tree_id":"057c50c6e057899704d2ad0e0005969db81d9574","distinct":true,"message":"Add activity module build notes; include pre-existing uncommitted docs\n\nskills/activity-module-notes.md documents this session's decisions\n(terminology translation, the reverted architecture conflict, what was\nalready built vs. new, the